1
00:00:04,857 --> 00:00:06,107
SHELDON:
Mm.

2
00:00:12,281 --> 00:00:14,871
(Sheldon:)Well, this is very pleasant.

3
00:00:15,743 --> 00:00:17,703
(Leonard:)I'm glad you're enjoying yourself.

4
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:21,710
And you said there would never
be enough pasta for the three of us.

5
00:00:21,874 --> 00:00:23,544
(Leonard:)I stand corrected.

6
00:00:23,709 --> 00:00:26,339
(Sheldon:)You know,
Italian housewives have a rule of thumb:

7
00:00:26,503 --> 00:00:29,093
(Sheldon:)A handful of dry pasta
about an inch in diameter...

8
00:00:29,256 --> 00:00:33,966
(Sheldon:)...is sufficient for each person,
as it doubles in volume when cooked.

9
00:00:34,511 --> 00:00:35,641
(Steph:)That's very interesting.

10
00:00:35,804 --> 00:00:39,304
(Penny:)- Thank you.
- She doesn't mean it. She's just being nice.

11
00:00:41,310 --> 00:00:44,940
(Sheldon:)Well, Stephanie, since Leonard seems
to be dropping the conversational ball...

12
00:00:45,105 --> 00:00:47,565
(Sheldon:)...I guess I'll just have to pick it up.
Ahem.

13
00:00:54,949 --> 00:00:57,659
(Sheldon:)Have you ever witnessed a violent crime?

14
00:01:00,204 --> 00:01:01,834
(Penny:)- No.
- Good.

